  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Collab  Moi Univ -Linkop - Collabor Moi Univ-Linkop</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Samarb Moi Univ-Link&#xf6;ping</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research exchange Moi University and Linkoping University within Environmental Health. The support is composed of following comp.: Students exchange visits to Moi&amp;Link&#xf6;ping, Training programmes for health personell, development of research proposals up to doctorate level, strengthen international collaboration.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till utbildning inom Environmental health, Moi University o forskningsutbyte med Link&#xf6;pings Universitet. F&#xf6;ljande komponenter ing&#xe5;r: Studentutbyte 6/inst/&#xe5;r, vidareutbildningsprog., forskningsst&#xf6;dupp till doktorsniv&#xe5;, samverkan mellan Link&#xf6;pings univers. samt inter-nationellt n&#xe4;tverk.</narrative>
  </description>
